Global notes:
Note (G1): Note to Transition rates:
     Transition rates are energy adjusted
Note (G2): Note to Uncertainties:
    Uncertainties are expressed as absolute values and are calculated
    based on errors after energy adjustment. Transitions that have not
    been adjusted (because of missing observed energies) have no
    uncertainty values and are not adjusted for energy errors.
